# Base URL of the Groundwork API. Leave unset locally to use
# http://localhost:8000; set it in Vercel to your Render/Railway/Fly URL.
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed VITE_ to the browser — never put a secret here.
#
# Copy the REAL URL from your Render service page — do not guess it from the
# service name in render.yaml. If that name is already taken by someone else's
# service, Render assigns you a different hostname, and a guessed URL will
# happily point at a stranger's server.
VITE_API_URL=https://<your-actual-service>.onrender.com
